        <mxCell id="legend" value="Legend&#10;«include» — the base use case always performs the included behavior.&#10;«extend» — the extending use case adds optional/conditional behavior at an extension point.&#10;Blue = occupancy &amp; HVAC control   |   Green = reporting &amp; monitoring   |   Orange = redundancy &amp; failover" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=4;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1">
